			"notes": "ONE VERSION TO RULE THEM ALL!!!\n\nChanges:\n- **This version is compatible with every version of Iris/Oculus that contains the bad horses!** \nYou just need to pick the right one for your mod loader and use Java 17 or higher.\n- Fixes incompatibility with Ice and Fire mod (#6) \n- Fixes the visual bug with charged Creepers (#7)\n- Now only requires Java 17! (#8)\n- Doesn't even depend on Iris/Oculus anymore, so you can install it with just about any version of Minecraft past 1.16.5! (#9)\nNot much of a point to use without tho lol, since the bug doesn't exist without Iris/Oculus\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/HiiJax/Bad-Horse-Fix/compare/v2.1.0...v3.0.0"
